%X The 13th ACM SIGPLAN International Workshop on the State Of the Art in Pro-  gram Analysis (SOAP’24) is co-located with the 45th ACM SIGPLAN International  Conference on Programming Language Design and Implementation (PLDI’24). In  line with past workshops, SOAP’24 aims to bring together members of the program  analysis community to share new developments and shape innovations in program  analysis.
