%X It is our great pleasure to welcome you to the 23rd ACM SIGPLAN Erlang Workshop (Erlang’24), co-located with the annual International Conference on Functional Programming (ICFP), held in Milan, Italy. The workshop continues to be a forum for presenting research and experience reports on all aspects of theory, implementation, and applications of the Erlang language and BEAM-related technologies, covering topics in functional programming, concurrency, distribution, and reliability.
